# 1️⃣ Distinct Subsequences

## Problem

Count how many times:

```text
String T
```

appears as a subsequence in:

```text
String S
```

---

### Example

```text
S = rabbbit

T = rabbit
```

Answer:

```text
3
```

---

# 2️⃣ State Definition

```cpp
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```text
Ways to form

T[0...j]

from

S[0...i]
```

---

# 3️⃣ Base Cases

If target finished:

```cpp
j < 0
```

Answer:

```text
1
```

---

If source finished:

```cpp
i < 0
```

Answer:

```text
0
```

---

# 4️⃣ Recurrence

If characters match:

```cpp
take
+
notTake
```

Formula:

```cpp
dp[i][j]
=
dp[i-1][j-1]
+
dp[i-1][j]
```

---

If mismatch:

```cpp
dp[i][j]
=
dp[i-1][j]
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N*M)
```

---

# 5️⃣ Wildcard Matching

## Symbols

```text
? → Single Character

* → Any Sequence
```

---

### Example

```text
Pattern:

a*b?c

String:

axybxc
```

Answer:

```text
True
```

---

# 6️⃣ State

```cpp
dp[i][j]
```

Meaning:

```text
Pattern[0..i]

matches

String[0..j]
```

---

# 7️⃣ Recurrence

### Exact Match

```cpp
dp[i-1][j-1]
```

---

### '?'

```cpp
dp[i-1][j-1]
```

---

### '*'

Two Choices:

```cpp
Match Empty
```

or

```cpp
Match Characters
```

Formula:

```cpp
dp[i-1][j]
||
dp[i][j-1]
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N*M)
```

---

# 8️⃣ Best Time To Buy & Sell Stock I

## Problem

One Buy

One Sell

Maximum Profit.

---

### Example

```text
7 1 5 3 6 4
```

Answer:

```text
5
```

Buy:

```text
1
```

Sell:

```text
6
```

---

# 9️⃣ Observation

Maintain:

```cpp
Minimum Price
```

seen so far.

Profit:

```cpp
price[i]
-
minimumPrice
```

---

### Complexity

```text
O(N)
```

