# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Distinct Subsequences = Take + Not Take.

✅ Wildcard '*' has two choices.

✅ Stock DP always revolves around Buy/Sell state.

✅ Cooldown changes next index.

✅ Transaction limit adds one more DP dimension.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Wrong base cases in Distinct Subsequences.

❌ Mishandling '*' in Wildcard Matching.

❌ Forgetting cooldown day.

❌ Wrong transaction count updates.

❌ Not distinguishing Buy and Sell states.

